        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Finding a pillow that properly supports your neck without forcing you into one sleeping position can be difficult—especially if you switch between back and side sleeping. This ergonomic cervical pillow is shaped to gently guide your head and neck into a neutral position, helping reduce strain that often builds up overnight. The contoured design features subtle curves that cradle the neck while allowing the head to rest comfortably, which is especially helpful for people who wake up with stiffness or tension. Instead of flattening over time, the high-density memory foam adapts to your unique shape and pressure points, maintaining consistent support throughout the night. One standout advantage is its compact size. Unlike oversized contour pillows that feel awkward or restrictive, this design offers targeted support without overwhelming your sleeping space. It works well on standard mattresses and is also practical for travel, making it easy to maintain consistent neck support even when sleeping away from home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
